    "text": "2 hours ago FORSYTH COUNTY, N.C. — The Forsyth County Sheriff’s Office is searching for a missing 12-year-old boy. Deputies said Lucas Lilly was last seen near Cresthaven Road in Lewisville. He is described as having blonde hair and blue eyes. He was last seen wearing a clown onesie, which was black on one side and red on the other with ears on the hood, and black shoes. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
